  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"226\"><span data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"226\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחֶרֶב לֹא תַעֲבֹר<br data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"247\" />\nבְּאַרְצְכֶם.</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"311\" data-start=\"266\"><span data-end=\"311\" data-start=\"266\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְכַטְבָּ\"ם&nbsp;לֹא יַחְדּוֹר<br data-end=\"297\" data-start=\"294\" />\nבִּשְׁמֵיכֶם.</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"314\" data-start=\"313\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">---</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"370\" data-start=\"316\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵין רַעַשׁ<br data-end=\"330\" data-start=\"327\" />\nאֵין גַּעַשׁ<br data-end=\"345\" data-start=\"342\" />\nאֵין סָאוֹן<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵין אָסוֹן</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\">לִפְנֵי שֶׁאַתָּה מְחַפֵּשׂ בִּטָּחוֹן בַּחוּץ -<br />יַשֵּׁר אֶת לִבְּךָ מוּל בּוֹרַאֲךָ.</p></span><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><p style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"לֹא בְחַיִל וְלֹא בְכֹחַ כִּי אִם בְּרוּחִי אָמַר הֹ' צְבָאוֹת (זכריה ד ו)</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p>\"אִם בְּחֻקֹּתַי תֵּלֵכוּ\" = 1017 = \"וְאַרְאֵהוּ בִּישׁוּעָתִי\"</p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><b><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></b></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span>'</span><span><b>גִשְׁמֵיכֶם</b>' / '</span><span><b>מִטְרֵיכוֹן</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span>❖ גשם - מטר</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span>'<b>בְּעִתָּם</b>' / '<b>בְּעִדָּנְהוֹן</b>'</span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span>&nbsp;עת, זמן - עידן</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'</span><span><b>רְבָבָה</b>' / '<b>רִבּוֹתָא</b>'</span><br /></span><span>❖ עשרת אלפים - ריבוא</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span>'<b>תּוֹצִיאוּ</b>' / '<b>תְּפַנּוֹן</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial;